# Non-secret Gateway rewrite fragment for the company K8s ConfigMap/envFrom.
# Only K8s nodes can reach this provider; company-PC acceptance uses OpenAI + real KiRa.
# Merge with the deployment's other runtime configuration; this is not a full Settings file.
